      "content": "SP 81 SE             WESTON TURVILLE         MAIN STREET                                              north side 5/326                                        No.9 Cobblers Cottage 21/12/67                                              II Cottage. C17 altered. Timber frame with painted brick infill. Thatched roof with half hipped gables, brick chimney at rear, one eaves dormer to front. Door to RH with thatched canopy, modern leaded square bay window to LH. Listing NGR: SP8532510830"
